e,"text":"A skilled bounty hunter who wields two swords and a sharp tongue. His 'catchphrase' is \"baka neko\" (stupid cat), which he uses liberally on everyone, but especially Konoe. Despite his cold and arrogant attitude, he can be surprisingly caring."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Lamento Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15491"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db97f66f686ae674f36b7168714e86a3e3e5e58719e7fa8656805cb24251e455.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0ba8b3013ce8926c049422dd25d3b1471a71a2c038527a2ebded60ac66cb2d3c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"森川 智之","creatorId":"vndb:s53","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s53","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s53","name":"森川智之","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:4443","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c15492","characterName":"アサト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c15492"},"originalCharacterName":"アサト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"182"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A one-track minded warrior from the closed-off village of Kira. Having grown up being shunned by the other villagers, he is unaccustomed to interacting with others, and so he has a hard time dealing with crowds and a simplistic, almost child-like manner of speech. Despite his social awkwardness, he is very loyal and fiercely protective of those he likes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on Lamento Wiki & Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15492"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},